# Tenant data exports stay OUT of git -- config_data/ holds point-in-time
# backups of a live tenant. The only tracked content is the tenant-agnostic
# example set under config_data/fixtures/ (see the !fixtures re-includes below).
config_data*
config_data_archive*
# ...but DO track the committed example fixtures:
!config_data/
config_data/*
!config_data/fixtures/
!config_data/fixtures/**
